{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34005","headline":"顾道士亡弟子以束帛乞铭于余鲁望因赋戏赠日休奉和 · 皮日休","name":"顾道士亡弟子以束帛乞铭于余鲁望因赋戏赠日休奉和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师去东华却链形，门人求我志金庭。\n大椿枯後新爲记，仙鹤亡来始有铭。\n琼板欲刊知不朽，冰纨将受恐通灵。\n君才莫叹无兹分，合注神玄劒解经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}